mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.015</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.115</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.887</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.015</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.446</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.725</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.259</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.208</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.408</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.443</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2.878</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2.152</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1.636</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.652</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>V</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mtable columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"4pt\"><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.419</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.045</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.68</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.38</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.525</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.761</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.04</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.654</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.205</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.148</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.713</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0.262</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.712</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>0.63</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0.166</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We will use principal component analysis to reduce the dimensionality of the dataset. </p>\n<p>In order to reduce the dimensionality of the dataset, we will project the data onto the first few principal components.</p>We should pick components based on \n<div id=\"selectList-355903-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-355903-0\" style=\"width: 317px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">the amount of cumulative variance preserved</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 631px; top: 16897px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">the original number of features</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">if the singular value is greater than <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"183\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"200\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"213\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">if the eigenvalue is smaller than average</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">the amount of cumulative variance preserved</div></div></div>.<span class=\"proofSection\"></span><span class=\"proofSection\"><p></p>If we wish to preserve <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"214\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of the variance, we should reduce the dataset to \n<div id=\"selectList-355903-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-355903-1\" style=\"width: 107px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"204\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> dimensions</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 884px; top: 16941px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"201\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> dimension</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"202\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> dimensions</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"203\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> dimensions</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"204\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> dimensions</div></div></div>.</span></div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/green-checkmark.png\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>In reducing the dimensionality of the dataset, we aim to preserve as much of the original variance as possible. </p>\n<p>We should pick components based on <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"215\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"border: 1px solid lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 20.177em; margin: 0.4em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.4em; top: 0px; max-width: 20.177em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c68\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c66\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c76\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c76\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c20\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c70\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c72\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c76\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c64\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle style=\"border: 1px solid lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+4pt\" depth=\"+4pt\" lspace=\"4pt\" width=\"+8pt\"><mtext>the amount of cumulative variance preserved</mtext></mpadded></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>The variance along a principal component is equal to the corresponding eigenvalue of the covariance matrix, which is proportional to the square of the corresponding singular value of the data matrix.</p>\n<p>In our example, the singular values are\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"216\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-msub space=\"2\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.878</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.152</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.636</mn><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.652</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Let us now compute the cumulative variance preserved for different numbers of components.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The fraction of variance preserved by projecting the data onto the first principal component is \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"217\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-msubsup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D70E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.288em; margin-left: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-spacer style=\"margin-top: 0.18em;\"></mjx-spacer><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msubsup></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-munderover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.2em; padding-lef